n:doxa:passage:aeb21522b723626da37146b03465fbef6cb164088e7084f56f2d3d7cbfdba3f6","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5086d88fbf68c0413d14241baeb3f1fa","blockId":"gv-801447-b00028","start":0,"end":142,"exact":"Selective media coverage among the most-followed outlets polarizes society, fostering an environment conducive to aggression and hate speech. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:c5f03c73521427cedb4989105d3ed2b5b91960c75cecd7d72ac2e70cdd58d798","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5086d88fbf68c0413d14241baeb3f1fa","blockId":"gv-801447-b00028","start":142,"end":158,"exact":"Picheca recalls:"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:cbc50ff882567dd0f956162531adb67583a84c97ddd015bd0b32aff07a5c7151","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5086d88fbf68c0413d14241baeb3f1fa","blockId":"gv-801447-b00029","start":0,"end":166,"exact":"> I recently reported a post, shared by a Czech user, saying “This is what Free Palestine looks like,” over an illustration of men raping women and killing children. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:a5fb30eba9db3a05a46fdc84a26857dd6523dc280e4b2f36044bf39a49d298a2","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5086d88fbf68c0413d14241baeb3f1fa","blockId":"gv-801447-b00029","start":166,"end":293,"exact":"Racist remarks, unfortunately, are common, especially on social media, where people feel more protected in their exaggerations."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:a35ed087d576d0ae8df9f281e04742c3c530eb07be1718189e1a8478738e9fa6","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5086d88fbf68c0413d14241baeb3f1fa","blockId":"gv-801447-b00030","start":0,"end":123,"exact":"According to the Reuters report, only 30 percent of the population of the Czech Republic trusts the news most of the time. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:1ef3eedd31a86fd4c8c35f24c66e96eb26c93b636d1606f4e663678bb128bf29","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5086d88fbf68c0413d14241baeb3f1fa","blockId":"gv-801447-b00030","start":123,"end":203,"exact":"Selective coverage by public media may contribute to this relatively low trust. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:d8bb2a5890cba3442f1067b32bfe377c9f74908151b4513dd00aa693edaaa276","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5086d88fbf68c0413d14241baeb3f1fa","blockId":"gv-801447-b00030","start":203,"end":389,"exact":"Objective coverage is crucial not only to keep society informed but also to prevent polarization and potential radicalization, leading to outcomes such as anti-Semitism and Islamophobia."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:decision:a09cb96e32342c14a225a2bbf176fee8","@type":["doxa:Decision","prov:Entity"],"recordId":"a09cb96e32342c14a225a2bbf176fee8","outcome":"does_not_meet","generatedBy":"urn:doxa:run:b2a2edd4ca7047128a5e433d8a874530","evaluates":"urn:doxa:criterion:ihra:anti_jewish_generalization:2026-11-operational-1:07872328c821afca407bc3f824933eae27582cd486ab34cf52466ad43ab7b92a","scoredUnit":"urn:doxa:unit:5086d88fbf68c0413d14241baeb3f1fa:u_bd62777ea21a6bc3a04e7732","attribution":"unknown","speaker":"Unknown","speakerStance":"not_applicable","documentStance":"not_applicable","proposition":"","hypothetical":false,"reviewStatus":"unreviewed","unitContext":["urn:doxa:passage:aeb21522b723626da37146b03465fbef6cb164088e7084f56f2d3d7cbfdba3f6","urn:doxa:passage:c5f03c73521427cedb4989105d3ed2b5b91960c75cecd7d72ac2e70cdd58d798","urn:doxa:passage:cbc50ff882567dd0f956162531adb67583a84c97ddd015bd0b32aff07a5c7151","urn:doxa:passage:a5fb30eba9db3a05a46fdc84a26857dd6523dc280e4b2f36044bf39a49d298a2","urn:doxa:passage:a35ed087d576d0ae8df9f281e04742c3c530eb07be1718189e1a8478738e9fa6","urn:doxa:passage:1ef3eedd31a86fd4c8c35f24c66e96eb26c93b636d1606f4e663678bb128bf29","urn:doxa:passage:d8bb2a5890cba3442f1067b32bfe377c9f74908151b4513dd00aa693edaaa276"]},{"@id":"urn:doxa:decision:ef872a66a94a20715101b42c158eb2fb","@type":["doxa:Decision","prov:Entity"],"recordId":"ef872a66